# Threadsium environment variables. Copy to .dev.vars (wrangler dev) or set in the Cloudflare dashboard
# (Workers & Pages > threadsium > Settings > Variables and Secrets). Never commit real values; .env*, .dev.vars are git-ignored.
# Swap and Send need no keys: quotes are public eth_calls and every transaction is signed in the visitor's own wallet.

# Optional keyed Elysium 99901 RPC (secret if it contains an API key). Public RPCs are used without it.
# RPC_URL=

# Optional: base URL of a running Elywake deployment. When set, /api/whales passes its live signals through
# (all four types, full history). When empty, /api/whales runs the ported Elywake classifier on demand instead.
# ELYWAKE_API=https://elywake.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev

# Elywake's own deployment (a separate Worker, not part of Threadsium) uses these. Threadsium's port does not need them;
# they are listed so nothing from Elywake's .dev.vars has to be copied over.
#   TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN   secret, Elywake's channel poster only
#   RPC_HTTP             secret when it holds a provider key (e.g. Alchemy), Elywake's indexer only
